<!--
  Hardened-runtime entitlements of the flash tool's two executables (docs/MACOS_SIGNING.md section 4). Deliberately EMPTY:
  * no sandbox (com.apple.security.app-sandbox): a sandboxed app cannot start the elevated helper or open /dev/rdiskN;
  * no com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation: every bundled library (Python, Qt, PySide6, cryptography) is re-signed with
    the same Developer ID team, so library validation passes;
  * no com.apple.security.cs.allow-unsigned-executable-memory / allow-jit: the code uses no JIT and no ctypes callbacks on macOS
    (hififlash.platforms.darwin runs diskutil and uses fcntl only).
  Add an entitlement only after a signed build demonstrably fails without it, and record why next to it.
-->
